    "Installs SKILL.md and its companion files from the official GitHub repo. Keys/accounts are configured in the skill's detail page after install.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从官方 GitHub 仓库安装 SKILL.md 及配套文件。技能的密钥/账号配置见安装后的技能详情。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從官方 GitHub 倉庫安裝 SKILL.md 及配套檔案。技能的金鑰/賬號配置見安裝後的技能詳情。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These marketplaces use the same SKILL.md standard as this app (name/description front matter), so their skills install directly: find one you like, copy its SKILL.md URL, and paste it into Install from URL.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些市场使用与本应用相同的 SKILL.md 标准（name/description 前置元数据），技能可直接安装：找到想要的技能后，复制它的 SKILL.md 链接，粘贴到「从 URL 安装」。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些市場使用與本應用相同的 SKILL.md 標準（name/description 前置後設資料），技能可直接安裝：找到想要的技能後，複製它的 SKILL.md 連結，貼上到「從 URL 安裝」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Installed as “%@” — enable or disable it in the Skills list.": {
