    "Once at least one host is configured, the agent gains remote_shell (run commands over SSH) and remote_agent (drive Claude Code on that machine). Heavy work runs on the remote computer; light and offline work stays on-device. Passwords are stored only in this device's Keychain.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置至少一台主机后，Agent 将获得 remote_shell（经 SSH 执行命令）和 remote_agent（驱动那台机器上的 Claude Code）两个工具。重活在远程电脑上跑，轻量与离线任务仍留在设备本地。密码只保存在本机钥匙串。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置至少一臺主機後，Agent 將獲得 remote_shell（經 SSH 執行命令）和 remote_agent（驅動那臺機器上的 Claude Code）兩個工具。重活在遠端電腦上跑，輕量與離線任務仍留在裝置本地。密碼只儲存在本機鑰匙串。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stored in the local Keychain only — never synced, never logged. On a Mac, enable System Settings → Sharing → Remote Login first.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存在本机钥匙串——不同步、不记录日志。Mac 上需先开启 系统设置 → 共享 → 远程登录。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只儲存在本機鑰匙串——不同步、不記錄日誌。Mac 上需先開啟 系統設定 → 共享 → 遠端登入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Correction recorded permanently. It will be injected into every future session with top priority.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "纠正已永久记录，之后每个会话都会以最高优先级注入。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "糾正已永久記錄，之後每個會話都會以最高優先順序注入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud rejected the sync state (error 15) — rebuilding automatically…": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 拒绝了同步状态（错误 15），正在自动重建…"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 拒絕了同步狀態（錯誤 15），正在自動重建…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud keeps rejecting requests (error 15). Check iCloud status in system Settings, then use Force Full Sync. This can also be a temporary iCloud/beta-OS issue.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 持续拒绝请求（错误 15）。请检查系统设置中的 iCloud 状态，然后使用「强制完整同步」。也可能是 iCloud 服务或测试版系统的临时问题。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 持續拒絕請求（錯誤 15）。請檢查系統設定中的 iCloud 狀態，然後使用「強制完整同步」。也可能是 iCloud 服務或測試版系統的臨時問題。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
